  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-12-17T15:26:30.251Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Now hear me out. Eye tracking except its through animator parameters so you can animate the eyes yourself looking up, down, left and right! for example, for people who have 2D eye textures, we could animate the UV mesh of those eyes to look around!",
